  "step_3": "The information relevant to the decision reason — specifically, the identification of the minimum absolute value outcome as a sure outcome and the computation of a weighted sum of the sure outcome and differences — is not present in the verbal report. The individual does not mention any such calculation or comparison of weighted differences. Instead, the justification is based on risk aversion and the perceived value of certainty, without reference to the structured rule involving differences weighted by probabilities. Therefore, although both lotteries yield the same weighted sum according to the decision reason (500), the individual does not apply or refer to that rule. The justification reflects a different reasoning process (risk aversion), not the specific rule of the decision reason. Thus, the decision reason was not used in the deliberation process.",
